{"text": "Pinocchio ran home across the fields as fast as he could. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He found the door open, so he went inside, locked it, and sat on the floor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he heard a small voice that said, Cri cri cri. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was a big cricket that was climbing slowly up the wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am the Talking Cricket, and I have lived in this room for over a hundred years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Boys who disobey their parents and run away from home will never be happy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tomorrow I will run away, because I do not want to go to school, said Pinocchio. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then learn a trade, so you can earn your bread honestly, said the Cricket. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The only trade that I like is eating, sleeping, and playing all day, Pinocchio answered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Poor Pinocchio, I feel sorry for you, because you have a wooden head, the Cricket said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pinocchio grew angry, picked up a wooden hammer, and threw it toward the Cricket. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The room became very quiet, and the Talking Cricket said no more.", "alignment": {"characters": ["P", "i", "n", "o", "c", "c", "h", "i", "o", " ", "r", "a", "n", " ", "h", "o", "m", "e", " ", "a", "c", "r", "o", "s", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "e", "l", "d", "s", " ", "a", "s", " ", "f", "a", "s", "t", " ", "a", "s", " ", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", ",", " ", "s", "o", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "i", "n", "s", "i", "d", "e", ",", " ", "l", "o", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "i", "t", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "l", "o", "o", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", 